# seams-core's own with_chemfiles/with_readcon wraps (gpulite, linkcell,
# minimage, readcon-core, readcon-db, vesin): meson resolves every
# subproject-of-a-subproject against this top-level subprojects/, copying
# the wrap file here and fetching its source the first time `meson setup`
# or `pixi run setup` runs. Only subprojects/seams-core.wrap is this
# project's own pin.
